        {
          "label": "Listen for God in the quiet",
          "note": "Elijah discovers that God's presence is not limited to spectacular signs. The quiet voice matters too."
        },
        {
          "label": "Expect another great sign",
          "note": "Elijah has seen fire, rain, wind, and earthquakes. Now the story turns his attention from spectacle to listening."
